      ## Facts vs Assumptions

      Separate confirmed facts from guesses.

      ### Confirmed

      - ...

      ### Assumptions / Unverified

      - ...

      ## Open Questions

      List only questions that materially affect implementation.

      If there are none, write:

      None.
